03:41.780 --> 03:46.420
But I reckon they are going to go back and paint a grey bar over this neighbourhood in the not-too-distant future.

03:46.640 --> 03:48.820
We can see the same trend for quits, total private.

03:49.160 --> 03:50.840
I mean, look at the recession periods, okay?

03:50.920 --> 03:52.080
