03:53.940 --> 03:55.260
Same for quits, total non-farm.

03:55.720 --> 03:58.740
Same for temporary help services, as you can see right here.

03:58.740 --> 04:00.420
Again, just missing that grey bar.

04:00.780 --> 04:03.860
So this looks very much like we are indeed heading into a recession.

04:04.320 --> 04:07.360
And the labour market deterioration call continues to be in play too.

04:07.640 --> 04:08.160
