04:15.100 --> 04:17.800
Because if I draw your attention to this bottom column, okay?

04:17.880 --> 04:20.740
This is, keep in mind, April 25 to March 26.

04:21.100 --> 04:25.900
The 12-month average of the first print suggested we added 900k jobs.

04:25.900 --> 04:34.020
