04:34.020 --> 04:36.260
the data sets in this 12-month period.

04:36.580 --> 04:42.300
So just like inflation, this too is a narrative that is being orchestrated by some people at

04:42.300 --> 04:47.080
top that want the majority of the masses to just read the headline data and move on happily

04:47.080 --> 04:47.880
